From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 00:15:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/43] Peak trainers: Lv. 100 gym rematches and Elite Four
 round 3

- After becoming Champion, every Gym Leader offers unlimited rematches
  with a themed team of six Lv. 100 Gen 1-3 Pokemon
- A League official at the Indigo Plateau toggles the peak Elite Four +
  Champion challenge (round 3)
- Peak Pokemon: max IVs, a nature matching their moves, 252/252 EVs
- Generated by tools/hack/peak_trainers.py; uses unused RS trainer slots

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
